{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "怎么守",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 96.82,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "防御按层来。",
   "spoken": "防御按层来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.52,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.926
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "生成层，用 CSPRNG 或硬件随机源，满 256 位熵。不在 WASM 和浏览器 JS 里自己替换随机源。",
   "spoken": "生成层，用 CSPRNG 或硬件随机源，满 256 位熵。不在 WASM 和浏览器 JS 里自己替换随机源。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.34,
   "dur": 11.52,
   "speechStart": 3.34,
   "speechEnd": 14.636
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "签名层，用标准 EdDSA 或 RFC 6979。再用已知答案测试和差分测试，验证封装层。",
   "spoken": "签名层，用标准 EdDSA 或 RFC 六九七九。再用已知答案测试和插分测试，验证封装层。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 15.08,
   "dur": 9.52,
   "speechStart": 15.08,
   "speechEnd": 24.399
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "监控层，扫描自家地址的签名，检测重复的 r 值。",
   "spoken": "监控层，扫描自家地址的签名，检测虫复的 r 值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 24.82,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 24.82,
   "speechEnd": 28.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "靶号工具，不用来生成管理员或金库地址。MPC 库，逐项审计证明，及时升级。",
   "spoken": "靶号工具，不用来生成管理员或金库地址。MPC 库，逐项审计证明，及时升级。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 29.84,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 29.943,
   "speechEnd": 36.523
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "生成缺陷修复后，强制用户迁移到新地址。",
   "spoken": "生成缺陷修复后，强制用户迁移到新地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 36.94,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 36.94,
   "speechEnd": 40.727
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "按角色，今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 41.16,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 41.257,
   "speechEnd": 43.561
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "钱包开发者，搜一遍密钥生成代码，确认没有时间戳种子、Math.random 和 mt19937。",
   "spoken": "钱包开发者，搜一遍密钥生成代码，确认没有时间戳种子、Math 点 random 和 MT 一九九三七。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 44.02,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 44.113,
   "speechEnd": 52.449
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "审计和安全团队，查一遍金库和管理员地址，是不是靶号工具生成的。",
   "spoken": "审计和安全团队，查一遍金库和管理员地址，是不是靶号工具生成的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 52.88,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 52.88,
   "speechEnd": 58.248
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "普通用户，只用主流钱包生成助记词。厂商一公告随机数缺陷，立刻把资产转到新钱包生成的新地址。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，只用主流钱包生成助记词。厂商一公告随机数缺陷，立刻把资产转到新钱包生成的新地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 58.7,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 58.7,
   "speechEnd": 67.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。一把 256 位的私钥，为什么只值 32 位？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 67.56,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 67.657,
   "speechEnd": 73.556
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "因为私钥的强度，取决于生成它的熵。熵只有 32 位，位数再多，也只有 32 位。",
   "spoken": "因为私钥的强度，取决于生成它的熵。熵只有 32 位，位数再多，也只有 32 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 74.3,
   "dur": 7.52,
   "speechStart": 74.3,
   "speechEnd": 81.629
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "256 位的强度要成立，有三个条件。熵满 256 位，nonce 不可预测，实现不偏离标准。",
   "spoken": "256 位的强度要成立，有三个条件。熵满 256 位，nonce 不可预测，实现不偏离标准。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 82.04,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 82.144,
   "speechEnd": 90.177
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "私钥只有它的种子那么强。下一集讲 EVM 与 Solidity。",
   "spoken": "私钥只有它的种子那么强。下一集讲 EVM 与 Solidity。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep02/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 90.58,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 90.58,
   "speechEnd": 95.449
  }
